### Breadth-First Search (BFS)
Explore nodes by **layers** using a FIFO queue. Guarantees the **fewest-steps solution** when all actions have equal cost.

**Tree-search pseudocode**
```
BFS(start, goal_test):
    Q = queue([start]); parent = {start: None}; visited = {start}
    while Q:
        n = Q.dequeue()
        if goal_test(n): return path(parent, n)
        for s in successors(n):
            if s not in visited:
                visited.add(s); parent[s] = n; Q.enqueue(s)
    return failure
```
**Guarantees:** Complete; **Optimal** for unit cost.  
**Cost:** Time/Space `O(b^d)`.
